RUSH TO GUN CONTROL, CHRIS

00:00:52.568 --> 00:00:54.403
MURPHY FOR MY HOME STATE OF

00:00:53.269 --> 00:00:56.939
CONNECTICUT INSTANTLY GOES TO

00:00:54.537 --> 00:00:59.542
THE FLOOR OF THE SENATE AND SAYS

00:00:57.073 --> 00:01:03.046
THIS IS DISGUSTING, POINTING THE

00:00:59.675 --> 00:01:05.248
FINGER AT NRA POLITICIANS.

00:01:03.179 --> 00:01:06.482
&gt;&gt; ANY TIME THERE IS ANY KIND OF

00:01:05.381 --> 00:01:07.617
