00:01:39.082 --> 00:01:43.387
MOCK PRAYING FOR PEOPLE.

00:01:42.185 --> 00:01:44.621
&gt;&gt; Laura: IT’S SO TRITE.

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:46.923
&gt;&gt; I NEEDED THOSE PRAYERS, THEY

00:01:44.755 --> 00:01:49.126
