00:01:47.057 --> 00:01:51.762
COULD FEEL THESE FAMILIES NEED

00:01:49.259 --> 00:01:52.963
PRAYER, THEY NEED HELP.

00:01:51.895 --> 00:01:54.698
LET’S GO FIND OUT THE ROOT OF

00:01:53.096 --> 00:01:56.366
THESE PROBLEMS.

00:01:54.831 --> 00:01:57.034
WE ARE ALREADY SEEING THERE ARE

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.235
SO MANY THINGS THAT SLIPPED

00:01:57.167 --> 00:02:01.872
THROUGH THE CRACKS.

00:01:58.369 --> 00:02:03.273
THE TELLTALE SIGNS WERE THERE.

00:02:02.006 --> 00:02:04.575
THIS KID WAS THE ONE WE KNEW

00:02:03.407 --> 00:02:07.044
WOULD BE A SHOOTER, WHY DIDN’T

