00:02:40.945 --> 00:02:44.449
MURDERING PEOPLE.

00:02:41.446 --> 00:02:46.050
IT’S AGAINST THE LAW.

00:02:44.582 --> 00:02:47.785
THIS IDEA THAT ONE MAGIC LAW IS

00:02:46.184 --> 00:02:49.454
GOING TO STOP THE NEXT ONE FROM

00:02:47.919 --> 00:02:50.955
HAPPENING, IT’S NOT.

00:02:49.587 --> 00:02:53.124
WHAT YOU DO SEE IN COMMON, YOU

00:02:51.089 --> 00:02:55.994
SEE A LOT OF MENTAL ILLNESS.

00:02:53.258 --> 00:02:58.229
YOU SEE GUN FREE ZONES, SHOOTERS

00:02:56.127 --> 00:02:58.930
KNOW IF YOU GO TO A GUN FREE

00:02:58.363 --> 00:03:02.033
ZONE YOU’RE THE ONLY ONE WITH

00:02:59.063 --> 00:03:03.768
THE GUN.

00:03:02.167 --> 00:03:04.469
I HAD TO LAW ENFORCEMENT AGENTS

00:03:03.902 --> 00:03:05.971
THAT WERE WITH ME THAT COULD

00:03:04.602 --> 00:03:09.107
