EVERY DAY IN AMERICA THERE ARE

00:03:14.179 --> 00:03:17.816
PEOPLE WHO USE GUNS TO STOP

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:18.250
CRIMES, TO DEFEND THEIR OWN

00:03:17.949 --> 00:03:19.718
