PRAY FOR THE FAMILIES, CARED

00:03:29.061 --> 00:03:30.796
ABOUT THESE FAMILIES DON’T TRY

00:03:30.195 --> 00:03:32.531
TO PROMOTE YOUR AGENDA IN THE

00:03:30.929 --> 00:03:33.732
