00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:46.378
YOU HAVE SUCH AN UNBELIEVABLE

00:03:44.743 --> 00:03:47.646
ATTITUDE, THERE’S SO MANY DARK

00:03:46.512 --> 00:03:48.881
DAYS.

